  "changeDescription": "Shared cameraPowerTier and complete mains-model union drive cell suppression, live-media budgets and standalone session tiers. Preserve prior state-freshness guards, native RTC and command keepalive. Accept correlated passive-command replies through 12 seconds with fallback information read at 8 seconds; bounded authoritative late-effect reconciliation for attached mains floodlight writes. Validated demand-only media topology snapshots remove repeated admission roster/model work, invalidate on account/session epoch and roster topology changes, and retain independent station reservations and feed leases. Eligible strictly correlated -108 station wait-timeout replies resolve the facade as pending acceptance only while the transmitted late-effect job is current; authoritative observations, bounded expiry and rejection behavior for other commands/codes remain intact.",
